bin/
# Stray Go build output — `go build ./cmd/seed` at repo root without -o
# produces an executable named `seed`. Other cmd/ names (web, render, dev)
# collide with real source directories so we don't add them here; discipline
# via `-o bin/<x>` is the fix for those.
/seed
.env
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
dist/
tmp/
node_modules/
docs/plans/

*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
!web/static/samples/*.sqlite
test-results/
playwright-report/
.playwright/
